## Integration with `montrs-test`

The `montrs-test` package re-exports benchmarking utilities for convenience in unit tests.

```rust
use montrs_test::unit::bench;

#[tokio::test]
async fn test_perf() {
    bench("quick_check", 100, || async {
        // ...
    }).await;
}
```
